message: "If you use CityShield in research, please cite this software and the relevant upstream projects and datasets."
title: "CityShield: Urban Climate and Geospatial Risk Intelligence"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "CityShield contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/bibek200620/cityshield"
